"name": "Bancorp Inc",
"description": "The Bancorp, Inc. is a financial holding company, which engages in the provision of private label banking and financial services through the Bank. It operates through the following segments: Fintech Solutions and Credit Solutions. The Fintech Solutions segment delivers payment, deposit, and lending products that attract deposits and generate fee income. The Credit Solutions segment engages in the provision of lending services, including real estate bridge lending, institutional banking products such as SBLOCs and IBLOCs, advisor financing, and commercial loans including small business and lease financing. The company was founded by Betzy Z. Cohen on July 20, 1999 and is headquartered in Wilmington, DE.",
